<title>USA: PHLX switches Orbotech options launch to May 7.</title>
<headline>PHLX switches Orbotech options launch to May 7.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Friday it switched to May 7 the opening date for options on Orbotech Ltd stock.</p>
<p>It originally slated a May 5 launch.</p>
<p>Strike prices for the options will be 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2, with expiration months of June, July, October and January.</p>
